# Beats — the Glitchers (the way out)
#
# A Glitch contact works the cells. To a captured guest it offers the
# exploit — a live `<escape:>` that, the first time it lands, reveals the
# resistance to the whole room. To anyone still free it's just a rumour.

== glitch_offer(guest)
  cast: Glitch, guest
  GLITCH
    <after: guest.captured>
      # A list comprehension over the live population, counted live.
      <let: trapped = count([p for p in Persons where p.captured])>
      Psst. {trapped} of us boxed in here. I found a gap in the firewall.
      You want out, or not?
    <otherwise>
      We're the Glitchers. When the walls close on you, look for the static.
  <if: guest.captured>
    # The whole cell hears the rumour ripple — a location-scoped broadcast.
    <broadcast: roll_call to location(Internet)>
    * Take the exploit — run for it
      <escape: guest>
    + Not yet. Lay low.
      <set: guest.karma += 5>
